$BG,0$$FG,15$ZealOS Text Browser$FG,0$$BG,15$

A text-only HTTP browser. No JavaScript. No HTTPS.

$FG,2$Load$FG$

	#include "C:/Home/Net/Programs/Browser/Run.ZC"

For remote pages, configure networking first:

	#include "C:/Home/Net/Start.ZC"

$FG,2$Commands$FG$

	HttpGet("http://example.com/");
	  Download and print stripped text to the console.

	Browser();
	  Interactive browser with clickable links.

	Browser("file:/Home/Net/Programs/Browser/TestFixtures/Sample.HTML");
	  Open a specific URL.

$FG,2$Keyboard shortcuts (interactive browser)$FG$

	Alt+B — Back
	Alt+F — Forward
	Alt+R — Refresh
	Alt+L — Location bar
	Shift+Esc — Exit

$FG,2$Network smoke test$FG$

	#include "C:/Home/Net/Programs/Browser/Tests/HttpSmokeTest.ZC"
	HttpSmokeTest("example.com", "/");

$FG,2$Local test (no network)$FG$

	BrowserLoadPlain("file:/Home/Net/Programs/Browser/TestFixtures/Sample.HTML");
